# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — OHOS linux/prctl.h vs sys/prctl.h prctl_mm_map 重定义 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-22
# Software: hashrat 1.25（libUseful-bundled 5.45）
# Gate: conan create build() / make 编译
# Status: UNMATCHED — 知识库（index.tsv/doc/graph/drafts）检索 0 命中，待 promote

id: draft-hashrat-1.25-prctl-mm-map-redefinition
title: OHOS sysroot linux/prctl.h 与 sys/prctl.h 重复定义 struct prctl_mm_map，删除冗余 include 解决
trigger_tool: clang / gcc
phase: compilation
error_signature: redefinition of 'prctl_mm_map'|previous definition is here.*linux/prctl.h|redefinition of 'struct prctl_mm_map'
severity: 3
category: toolchain|headers
match_keywords: prctl_mm_map, linux/prctl.h, sys/prctl.h, redefinition, OHOS, OpenHarmony, musl
keywords: prctl, PR_SET_DUMPABLE, PR_GET_DUMPABLE, PR_SET_NO_NEW_PRIVS,
  PR_GET_NO_NEW_PRIVS, kernel uapi, musl, libUseful, hashrat
approach: 删除 #include <linux/prctl.h>（保留 <sys/prctl.h>）——OHOS sys/prctl.h
  已含所需全部 PR_* 常量（PR_SET_DUMPABLE/PR_GET_DUMPABLE/PR_SET_NO_NEW_PRIVS/
  PR_GET_NO_NEW_PRIVS 实测均在），源码无 prctl_mm_map 类型使用；仅 __OHOS__ 守卫
  外层由 HAVE_PRCTL 条件包裹，非 OHOS 行为不变
root_cause: OHOS sysroot（musl + 内核 UAPI 头）中 linux/prctl.h 与 sys/prctl.h
  均定义 struct prctl_mm_map；源码先 include linux/prctl.h 再 include
  sys/prctl.h 时第二个头触发 redefinition
rec_approach: drop-redundant-linux-header
doc: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-hashrat-1.25-prctl-mm-map-redefinition.md
similar_to: E091, E119
